# Compass mockups

For a standalone mockup, use static HTML that can be opened directly or served without a compiler. For an app-integrated preview, use the hosted app or an appropriate hosted preview. A mockup request alone does not authorise starting `next dev`, `npm run dev`, or `pnpm dev`; start a local compiler only when Jules asks.

Use a design service when Jules names it. Otherwise choose code and a browser preview suited to the request. Apply the scope guidance in `compass-ui-lock.mdc`; a requested improvement can change the relevant layout and interaction.
